WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:43.490 --> 01:44.690
Alrighty...

01:52.370 --> 01:53.900
You're not running away today!

01:53.900 --> 01:56.810
'Cause the track and field sports
festival is tomorrow!

01:56.810 --> 01:58.840
You've got to come to the practice!

01:58.840 --> 02:00.470
Yeah, well...

02:01.580 --> 02:03.650
H-Hey! Let me go!

02:03.650 --> 02:05.100
No complaining!

02:05.480 --> 02:08.850
I don't wanna! I don't wanna practice!

02:10.350 --> 02:12.950
Run, Run! Friendship Relay

02:18.160 --> 02:19.780
Ugh, I don't feel like doing this.

02:20.060 --> 02:21.800
What are you saying?

02:21.800 --> 02:24.030
You were chosen to be in the relay.

02:24.030 --> 02:26.500
If you don't practice properly, it'll be bad!

02:26.870 --> 02:28.700
Well, you see...

02:28.700 --> 02:34.340
I was chosen originally cause I'm so
fast. So even if I don't practice...

02:34.340 --> 02:37.010
You have to pass the baton and other things too!

02:37.310 --> 02:38.650
R-Right?

02:38.650 --> 02:39.910
Chocolat-chan!

02:44.520 --> 02:47.420
I'm glad you came to practice today.

02:47.420 --> 02:54.030
Man, you're lucky, Vanilla. You're doing the long jump, where you can just rely on yourself.

02:54.030 --> 02:55.080
What do you mean?

02:55.660 --> 02:58.600
This relay things really weird.

02:58.600 --> 03:00.640
It's with teams of four people, see.

03:00.640 --> 03:05.340
And it's not just who's the fastest
among the four, either.

03:05.340 --> 03:07.610
Something like that'd never happen
in the Magical World.

03:10.910 --> 03:13.180
Isn't that just like the Human World?

03:14.500 --> 03:15.850
Oh, Kato!

03:15.850 --> 03:19.050
Your guys' team is really getting a lot of attention!

03:20.020 --> 03:22.260
Nichijou and Minamoto are in it too, right?

03:23.730 --> 03:24.930
So?

03:24.930 --> 03:29.830
Up to this year those two were always
first and second place at running.

03:31.330 --> 03:34.400
This is the first year they've been in the same class.

03:34.400 --> 03:38.240
For them both to run in the same relay,
everyone is saying they'll be the best.

03:38.240 --> 03:40.110
Those two, huh?

03:40.440 --> 03:41.840
Do your best too, Kato!

03:41.840 --> 03:44.510
Don't be a drag on those two, okay?

03:44.510 --> 03:46.850
You jerk! I'll whup your butt!

03:46.850 --> 03:49.120
Chocolat-chan, now's your chance!

03:50.080 --> 03:50.830
Chance?

03:51.590 --> 03:53.280
If you're getting lots of attention,

03:53.280 --> 03:57.890
then if you look cool running through the goal, can't you take a lot of hearts?

04:00.500 --> 04:01.620
Goal!

04:06.000 --> 04:06.600
Chocolat!

04:13.710 --> 04:15.080
Okay, good luck!

04:17.280 --> 04:19.550
Hey, I'm gonna run last!

04:20.180 --> 04:21.720
You want to be the anchor?

04:21.720 --> 04:23.990
What's with deciding that all
of a sudden on your own?

04:23.990 --> 04:26.850
Why not let Chocolat-chan be the anchor?

04:27.660 --> 04:30.120
Then she'll be more motivated.

04:30.120 --> 04:34.260
I'm fine with whatever the running order is.

04:36.060 --> 04:38.170
If you say so, Sakiko.

04:38.170 --> 04:40.590
Okay then, Chocolat, you're the anchor.

04:40.590 --> 04:44.100
Alright! Hey, let's hurry up and practice!

04:54.640 --> 04:55.350
Start!

04:57.620 --> 04:58.750
Here!

04:58.750 --> 04:59.990
Feels good!

05:17.970 --> 05:19.410
Oww...

05:27.950 --> 05:30.680
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

05:31.150 --> 05:31.820
Wand!

05:32.850 --> 05:34.950
Hearts, hearts, please come to me!

05:43.930 --> 05:45.430
Hehe, I took them.

05:48.440 --> 05:50.000
That's nice for you, Vanilla.

05:50.970 --> 05:56.970
But when I cross that finish line first,
I'll take a truck-load of hearts myself!

06:00.250 --> 06:02.220
Yeah, that feels about right!

06:02.220 --> 06:03.450
Yep, yep!

06:04.290 --> 06:06.350
Get motivated, and keep it light and fast!

06:07.660 --> 06:08.060
Here!

06:20.200 --> 06:21.070
Sakiko!

06:21.070 --> 06:22.040
Are you okay?

06:22.040 --> 06:23.910
Have you hurt or sprained yourself?

06:23.910 --> 06:28.610
No... I'm fine, just fine!

06:28.980 --> 06:31.080
Um, I'm sorry...

06:31.080 --> 06:33.830
This isn't the place to be playing soccer, you know!

06:37.040 --> 06:37.950
Ow...

06:37.950 --> 06:38.580
Sakiko!

06:38.990 --> 06:40.750
Are you really okay?

06:41.860 --> 06:45.490
Yeah... I just, totally fell down!

06:45.490 --> 06:48.560
Thank goodness. If you got injured
now, we'd be through...

06:48.560 --> 06:49.760
Yeah, man...

06:50.730 --> 06:54.850
Okay! Practice time is over!

06:54.850 --> 06:59.210
Everyone get changed and come inside!
Don't forget to bring in the equipment!

06:59.210 --> 07:00.310
Okay!

07:00.810 --> 07:01.910
Let's go, Sakiko.

07:01.910 --> 07:02.310
Right.

07:15.390 --> 07:17.620
Something's not right with Sakiko.

07:25.870 --> 07:26.670
Sorry about this!

07:28.840 --> 07:30.420
What are you-doing, Chocolat-chan!?

07:32.610 --> 07:34.270
As I thought, it's sprained.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.510
That's...

07:37.510 --> 07:39.450
Whoa, that's a bad sprain.

07:39.450 --> 07:41.350
But I said I'm okay...

07:41.350 --> 07:45.150
Yeah, if we go to the doctor, I'm sure they
can do something about it for tomorrow.

07:46.090 --> 07:47.650
Like hell they can!

07:50.020 --> 07:52.090
You can't run on that ankle!

07:52.090 --> 07:55.900
Yeah, you can't run with a sprain that bad.

07:55.900 --> 07:57.450
Yes I can!

07:57.970 --> 08:00.940
No way, it's impossible. We need
to choose a replacement.

08:00.940 --> 08:02.200
I'm going to the teacher.

08:02.200 --> 08:03.250
Stop!

08:04.810 --> 08:09.680
Please, wait untill tomorrow...
It'll be better tomorrow!

08:12.550 --> 08:15.180
I... I want to run!

08:15.680 --> 08:16.250
Okay.

08:16.950 --> 08:18.920
Please, wait until tomorrow!

08:23.620 --> 08:25.690
I just can't understand it!

08:25.690 --> 08:29.500
There's no way it'll be better by tomorrow!

08:29.500 --> 08:30.160
Yeah...

08:30.600 --> 08:33.200
Like, in the Centre Ecole marathon...

08:51.440 --> 08:54.450
Chocolat-chan, I'm okay, so hurry and go!

08:54.820 --> 08:55.520
Yeah!

09:02.960 --> 09:07.400
Since you were my partner, Vanilla-chan,
I won first place.

09:10.770 --> 09:11.780
Yeah.

09:12.110 --> 09:16.740
Sakiko should be the same, right? She has
to give up running for her friend Ayano.

09:17.080 --> 09:18.950
Yeah...

09:18.950 --> 09:21.880
And otherwise I won't be able to take any hearts!

09:21.880 --> 09:23.990
Y-Yeah, that's true...

09:23.990 --> 09:27.830
I've decided! I'm gonna go to Sakiko's
place and convince her to quit!

09:28.890 --> 09:31.390
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

09:43.640 --> 09:44.370
Wand!

09:54.740 --> 09:55.990
Alright!

09:56.280 --> 09:57.950
I'll go too!

09:57.950 --> 10:00.290
Transport us to Sakiko's house!

10:06.330 --> 10:07.130
Huh?

10:07.130 --> 10:08.300
It's so cramped...

10:08.300 --> 10:10.330
Where the heck is this?

10:10.330 --> 10:12.670
To sprain my ankle at a time like this...

10:26.810 --> 10:28.320
Ah, this is...

10:28.320 --> 10:31.440
We're inside Sakiko's closet.

10:32.620 --> 10:34.920
The doctor said it was impossible, too.

10:35.790 --> 10:38.590
I guess tomorrow's relay is no good after all.

10:39.590 --> 10:41.100
But I want to run!

10:41.100 --> 10:45.100
This might be my last chance
to run with you, Ayano...

10:45.830 --> 10:46.930
Sakiko...

10:50.000 --> 10:54.810
Why, Papa? Why must you suddenly
transfer to London?

10:55.280 --> 10:56.940
I don't want to be transferred!

10:58.580 --> 10:59.910
Transferred?

11:15.030 --> 11:19.270
The first time I ran against you was
when we were first graders, right?

11:20.700 --> 11:27.010
I didn't think anyone was faster than me...
It was the first time I'd seen a girl that fast.

11:28.160 --> 11:34.380
At first I just didn't want to loose to her, but more and more, I thought she was amazing...

11:34.380 --> 11:42.590
And after that, I realized that she was the same
as me, and that racing her was really fun.

11:42.860 --> 11:45.640
And then, and then...

11:45.640 --> 11:49.350
I think you'll always be running, Sakiko.

11:49.800 --> 11:52.570
Whenever, wherever... forever and ever.

11:52.570 --> 11:58.940
Yeah, that's right! And that someday we'd be in the same class, and run the relay together.

11:58.940 --> 12:04.110
We're finally in the same class, and I've always been looking forward to running the relay.

12:04.680 --> 12:05.480
And then...

12:06.710 --> 12:12.120
It has to be tomorrow. After that, we might
not be able to run together again.

12:12.390 --> 12:15.090
I want to be in the relay!

12:15.590 --> 12:20.230
I might not be able to run well, and I'm sorry
about Natsume and Chocolat-chan...

12:21.330 --> 12:24.800
But I want to run, one last time!
Together with you, Ayano...

12:25.970 --> 12:27.100
Sakiko...

12:29.540 --> 12:32.810
Chocolat-chan, please let them run together!

12:36.860 --> 12:38.860
Chocolat-chan, Vanilla-chan?

12:38.860 --> 12:40.850
Ah, well...

12:40.850 --> 12:44.860
Um, we came earlier, and your mom was
like, "wait in her room," and I'm like...

12:44.860 --> 12:49.580
the kind of person who likes to
wait in tight spaces, see and...

12:50.660 --> 12:52.370
Sakiko, you should be in the relay!

12:54.060 --> 12:55.400
I understand your feelings.

12:55.400 --> 12:59.470
If I were gonna be separated from Vanilla,

12:59.470 --> 13:02.380
I'd definitely want to be in the relay with her at the end.

13:05.270 --> 13:07.390
Chocolat-chan...

13:09.610 --> 13:10.390
Thank you...

13:10.710 --> 13:16.600
I didn't realize you were that compassionate,
Chocolat-chan. I'm sorry about before.

13:16.950 --> 13:19.090
Well, I'm...

13:23.620 --> 13:26.530
You really are kind, Chocolat.

13:26.530 --> 13:28.700
Even though you said you wanted to come in first.

13:30.630 --> 13:32.290
Oh, we'll come in first all right.

13:36.200 --> 13:41.200
One, two, three, four, fix, six...

13:41.200 --> 13:42.680
Sugar Sugar Rune!

13:54.820 --> 13:57.190
Here's ya order, the "zoom-zoom shoes."

13:58.090 --> 13:59.290
Thanks!

14:07.170 --> 14:12.610
The "zoom-zoom shoes" are running shoes that'll
make you go super fast just by putting them on.

14:12.610 --> 14:14.940
I see! If she puts these on tomorrow...

14:14.940 --> 14:19.210
Sakiko-chan will run real well,
and I'll get lots of hearts!

14:19.510 --> 14:24.760
Yeah! It'll be a great memory if Sakiko-chan
and you all get first place.

14:25.190 --> 14:26.220
Yeah!

15:04.360 --> 15:05.160
Sakiko!

15:06.390 --> 15:07.330
Chocolat-chan...

15:08.000 --> 15:10.200
Look what I've got. A present!

15:13.570 --> 15:15.440
Running shoes?

15:15.440 --> 15:17.200
Here, put these on and run.

15:17.670 --> 15:22.680
They've got a good luck charm in them, so
that you'll run like you'd never believe!

15:22.680 --> 15:23.640
For sure!

15:24.850 --> 15:25.950
Chocolat-chan...

15:27.690 --> 15:29.890
Thank you! This makes me so happy,

15:29.890 --> 15:33.690
that you were worrying about me this much, Chocolat-chan...

15:35.160 --> 15:36.160
Well, thanks...

15:36.420 --> 15:41.710
I'll wear them. I'll wear them,
and run as hard as I can!

15:42.400 --> 15:42.830
Yeah!

15:47.600 --> 15:50.970
Oh yeah, there's no way we'll lose now.

15:50.970 --> 15:52.510
And then it's an all-you-can-take heart buffet!

15:52.510 --> 15:54.010
Chocolat-chan!

15:58.850 --> 16:01.380
You're just as stupid as always, Chocolat.

16:01.380 --> 16:02.350
What?

16:02.350 --> 16:07.520
Chocolat-chan, it says that only boys
can wear the zoom-zoom shoes.

16:09.460 --> 16:15.190
For girls, it's not the zoom-zoom shoes,
but the zwoom-zwoom shoes.

16:17.060 --> 16:19.970
I screwed up!

16:23.540 --> 16:25.410
Chocolat, the relays next!

16:25.410 --> 16:26.610
Hurry, hurry!

16:30.540 --> 16:32.570
Ah, it's no use!

16:33.350 --> 16:35.080
Thanks, Chocolat-chan.

16:36.120 --> 16:39.810
I heard about it too, about how
you gave Sakiko those shoes.

16:40.250 --> 16:42.860
You're really kind, Chocolat-chan.

16:42.860 --> 16:44.620
Sakiko thinks so too.

16:45.060 --> 16:48.750
Us three have to make up for
Sakiko, and do our best!

16:49.800 --> 16:50.820
Uh, sure.

16:54.870 --> 16:56.170
Take your marks...

16:57.140 --> 16:58.490
Get set...

17:02.310 --> 17:04.010
Great start, Natsume!

17:12.950 --> 17:14.020
Here, Sakiko!

17:17.890 --> 17:21.100
I've got to do my best! I'm running
together with Ayano!

17:21.100 --> 17:24.200
And Chocolat-chan tried so hard for me!

17:25.330 --> 17:27.200
Sakiko-chan, wow!

17:27.200 --> 17:28.770
Go, Minamoto!

17:31.320 --> 17:33.740
How? How can she run?

17:35.240 --> 17:37.550
Sakiko is actually a boy?!

17:37.550 --> 17:38.680
No!

17:40.210 --> 17:45.520
Sakiko is running with the power
of humans, not the magic shoes.

17:45.520 --> 17:47.790
The power of humans?

17:48.520 --> 17:50.930
Even if humans think
something's impossible,

17:50.930 --> 17:53.590
they can overcome it with the strength of their feelings.

17:54.660 --> 17:58.240
I can do it! I can do it! I can, I can...

18:03.440 --> 18:04.300
Sakiko!

18:05.240 --> 18:06.560
Ah, she fell!

18:11.210 --> 18:15.280
I'll run! I'll run, and definitely, definitely
pass Ayano the baton!

18:16.120 --> 18:18.280
Sakiko! You can do it, Sakiko!

18:19.220 --> 18:21.310
Wow... It's amazing...

18:21.310 --> 18:22.660
You can do it!

18:23.320 --> 18:24.290
Don't give up!

18:28.300 --> 18:30.220
Ayano, please!

18:31.370 --> 18:32.540
Leave it to me!

18:35.470 --> 18:41.210
I'll do my best. I'm finally running with
Sakiko, and she tried so hard...

18:41.210 --> 18:44.300
I'm gonna run too. I'm gonna run!

18:45.450 --> 18:50.280
Ayano is amazing too. The power
of humans is really amazing!

18:52.810 --> 18:54.540
I'm burning with passion,

18:54.540 --> 18:58.260
like Sakiko and Natsume and Aya have transferred their power to me!

19:01.930 --> 19:03.530
Please, Chocolat-chan!

19:08.060 --> 19:09.670
Go for it, Kato!

19:13.360 --> 19:15.090
Chocolat-chan!

19:16.600 --> 19:17.580
Chocolat!

19:19.910 --> 19:21.080
Chocolat-chan!

19:57.880 --> 20:01.250
Chocolat-chan! Thank you, Chocolat-chan!

20:01.760 --> 20:03.460
That was the best!

20:03.460 --> 20:05.460
Wow, amazing!

20:07.090 --> 20:08.860
Y-Yeah...

20:10.600 --> 20:13.430
Why? Even though I came in second...

20:13.430 --> 20:15.200
They're really happy.

20:19.770 --> 20:22.840
C-Chocolat, hurry and take the hearts!

20:22.840 --> 20:25.580
Chocolat isn't noticing.

20:25.580 --> 20:30.500
Chocolat has something more important
than taking hearts right now.

20:40.630 --> 20:41.490
Chocolat-chan!

20:42.660 --> 20:43.430
What is it?

20:45.370 --> 20:46.500
I'm sorry!

20:46.500 --> 20:49.180
I'm not actually transferring anymore.

20:50.540 --> 20:53.470
My papa's transfer was suddenly reversed.

20:54.440 --> 20:59.210
I'm sorry. If I had known earlier,
I would have let someone else run.

20:59.210 --> 21:02.050
And then I'm sure we would have gotten first place.

21:02.050 --> 21:06.050
I'm sorry, Chocolat-chan. I know you
wanted to come in first really badly.

21:08.490 --> 21:09.700
So you're not transterring, huh?

21:11.890 --> 21:16.860
Isn't that good? Then you can run next year, right?

21:16.860 --> 21:20.300
Let's get first then, for sure! Us four!

21:20.300 --> 21:20.900
Yeah!

21:25.310 --> 21:26.910
Thank goodness.

21:28.640 --> 21:29.340
What's wrong?

21:29.980 --> 21:32.580
Yeah. At that Magic Marathon...

21:34.980 --> 21:42.110
Back then, did you actually want to fly together?

21:43.860 --> 21:45.330
No, I didn't...

21:45.330 --> 21:49.620
I wanted to see you get first place, Chocolat-chan.

21:50.000 --> 21:53.430
I see. Although today I only came in second.

21:53.430 --> 21:56.470
Your second place today was cooler than first place.

22:00.410 --> 22:01.810
About the Queen Candidates...

22:05.750 --> 22:07.880
In the race of the Queen Candidates...

22:08.350 --> 22:10.280
Let's do our best together, right?

22:23.120 --> 22:29.450
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.950
"Love"

22:31.860 --> 22:35.370
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.780
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.210 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.960 --> 23:00.230
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.830 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.200 --> 23:11.270
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.640 --> 23:16.080
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.080 --> 23:26.190
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.250 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.550 --> 23:47.990
It's here! It's here, it's here, it's here!

23:47.990 --> 23:51.790
Finally I'm the most popular of all in the Human World!

23:51.790 --> 23:54.580
That's because of the "Super Popular Barret"!

23:54.580 --> 23:56.200
Don't make a mistake!

23:56.200 --> 23:57.940
Doesn't matter to me.

23:57.940 --> 24:02.720
Right now I'm a heart hunter, those who I aim for won't get away!

24:02.720 --> 24:05.950
Give me a break. You don't know anything.

24:05.950 --> 24:08.020
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.020 --> 24:10.070
Goodbye, heart hair ornament.

24:10.640 --> 24:13.610
Okay, everyone, give me all your hearts!
